{"id":"a89886ac0073ec91","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-solovay-s-test.md","title":"总 Solovay s 检验与无限覆盖","display":"df-solovay-s-test — 总 Solovay s 检验与无限覆盖","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-solovay-s-test","aliases":["43-df-solovay-s-test"],"display":"df-solovay-s-test — 总 Solovay s 检验与无限覆盖","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-prefix]]","[[43-df-computable-real]]","[[43-df-schnorr-s-test]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Definition 17.8.2","source_printed_pages":"533–534","source_pdf_pages":"553–554","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-solovay-s-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-solovay-s-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-solovay-s-test — 总 Solovay s 检验与无限覆盖"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"801a9dba9cbba1c7\" href=\"?note=801a9dba9cbba1c7\" title=\"43-df-prefix\">43-df-prefix</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"96d58aa7b6884a9b\" href=\"?note=96d58aa7b6884a9b\" title=\"43-df-computable-real\">43-df-computable-real</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fe3a2e8b1893c3da\" href=\"?note=fe3a2e8b1893c3da\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-s-test\">43-df-schnorr-s-test</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 17.8.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"533–534"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"553–554"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(D\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq\">\\(\\sqsubseteq\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ComputableReal}\">\\(\\operatorname{ComputableReal}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"801a9dba9cbba1c7\" href=\"?note=801a9dba9cbba1c7\" title=\"43-df-prefix\">43-df-prefix</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"96d58aa7b6884a9b\" href=\"?note=96d58aa7b6884a9b\" title=\"43-df-computable-real\">43-df-computable-real</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_s\">\\(w_s\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fe3a2e8b1893c3da\" href=\"?note=fe3a2e8b1893c3da\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-s-test\">43-df-schnorr-s-test</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SolovaySTest}(s,D)\\iff\\operatorname{CE}(D)\\land w_s(D)\\le1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SolovaySTest}(s,D)\\iff\\operatorname{CE}(D)\\land w_s(D)\\le1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalSolovaySTest}(s,D)\\iff\\operatorname{SolovaySTest}(s,D)\\land\\exists r\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(r=w_s(D)\\land\\operatorname{ComputableReal}(r)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TotalSolovaySTest}(s,D)\\iff\\operatorname{SolovaySTest}(s,D)\\land\\exists r\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(r=w_s(D)\\land\\operatorname{ComputableReal}(r)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SolovaySCovers}(D,X)\\iff\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in D\\;\\left(|\\sigma|\\ge N\\land\\sigma\\sqsubseteq X\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SolovaySCovers}(D,X)\\iff\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in D\\;\\left(|\\sigma|\\ge N\\land\\sigma\\sqsubseteq X\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>覆盖要求无限多个不同长度的初段。有限实数见证确保计算性谓词的输入类型闭合。总性指权重总和可计算，不要求描述机器为总函数。这里只定义对象，Theorem 17.8.3 的类级等价仍由原书提供。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Definition 17.8.2，印刷页 533–534，PDF 页 553–554。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefix","status":"resolved","id":"801a9dba9cbba1c7"